  <section class="hero case-hero">
    <div>
      <div class="case-eyebrow">Confidential FinTech case study</div>
      <h1>15 qualified demos. Three closed deals. <span class="highlight">One focused 90 day campaign.</span></h1>
      <p class="case-hero-lead">A payments platform needed consistent conversations with merchants that had a real reason to review their payment environment. The campaign combined focused account selection, human calling, structured follow up, qualification, and a clean demo handoff.</p>
      <div class="case-hero-note"><i></i> Payment technology · Merchant services · B2B appointment setting</div>
    </div>

